      "changes": [
        "Derive the auxiliary arithmetic-mean polynomial bound for the two actual lifted merge deficits against the literal common good-copy density on QC\u00d7VR. The physical space is Q\u00d7(Y\u00d7V); every Y coordinate is traced. The unit ground norm, original simultaneous copy symmetry, actual exchanged component norm and both local moments are derived without separate swapped, moment, purity, independence or marginal-invariance certificates. Arbitrary reala with2*a\u22641, zero components and zero copies are included. This is not the printed Cauchy\u2013Schwarz geometric-mean or full inverse-filter theorem."
